            "review_id": "REV_33119486_p1_0",
            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at King Bar & Lounge",
            "review_text": "Alex Miller\nHonolulu, Hawaii11 contributions\n1\nBe careful where you go\nMar 2026 • Friends\nAlways pay for your drinks right away, guys. Do not choose the \"unlimited drinks\" deal. We only drank for one hour and then stopped. When we asked for the bill, they charged us double. We had to pay 3 million for just 11 beers! In the end, I also had to buy 10 extra beers to take home, and they were way too expensive.\n\nBe careful where you go. There are plenty of other lounges that won't cheat you. Remember to always pay first.\n\nThe waitresses were nice, but the manager will try to steal your money. I will never go back. Other places deserve my money more, especially after this scam.\nRead more\nWritten April 18, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
