            "review_title": "Review at King Bar & Lounge",
            "review_text": "Manuel J\n1 contribution\n1\nSCAM BAR charged me 40,000,000 VND ($1,500)\nMar 2026 • Solo\nAvoid this SCAM BAR in Da Nang!!! I stayed there for only 3 hours and got charged 40,000,000 VND ($1,500), because all of the 6 bar girls kept treating themselves for dozens of $9 Tiger beers (300ml). Please check your bill after every order or they will milk your wallet… After I paid 15,000,000 VND in the bar, I brought two girls that I liked to the private Karaoke room upstairs for a more intimate experience. What I didn’t expect was that the other four girls from the bar downstairs kept following us without my permission and pumped up my new bill. In the Karaoke room, I got charged for another 44 beers. They basically wanted an extra 25,000,000 VND ($1,000) from me, which I could negotiate down to 20,000,000. It felt like a huge scam and I threatened to call the police. The owner should go to jail for this. The girls were kind, but they take advantage of your loneliness and drink more beer than Germans at Oktoberfest. I never left that much money at a bar before. They called me cheap and said an American customer paid them over 100M+ ($4,000) in one night. Don’t get tricked…\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 7, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
