            "review_text": "jwremy\nSanchong, New Taipei6 contributions\n0\nMiss is very beautiful\nDec 2025 • Friends\nWhen I came to Hong Kong, I went through a bar that looked like it was just opened, the atmosphere inside was great, and the staff was polite.\nThere is no problem in communicating in English, and I am surprised that there are also employees who speak Chinese! Communication is accessible, the sisters are very enthusiastic❤️ 🔥❤️ 🔥❤️ 🔥.\n\nIf you come with friends, they also have a private suitcase! Privacy is well protected.\n\nThe next time I come to Hong Kong, I will definitely visit again!\n\nAtmosphere: 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\nServices: 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟\nWhether you want a drink or interact with people, I highly recommend this bar!👍🏻\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten December 10, 2025",
